# Suffix denylist for auto-janitor.sh
# One domain per line. A line matches the domain itself and all its subdomains.
# Entries listed here are removed from auto.list on every janitor run.
#
# Useful for ad, analytics and telemetry hosts that nfqws2 keeps detecting as
# blocked while unblocking them is pointless.
#
# Example:
# ads.example.com
